ACC-017 — Engineering Traceability

Document ID: ACC-017
Title: Engineering Traceability
Version: 1.0.0-draft
Status: Draft

1. Purpose

This specification defines Engineering Traceability, the capability to identify, follow, and verify the relationships between engineering cognition, supporting information, and resulting engineering outcomes throughout the Atlas Engineering Cognition Framework (AECF).

Engineering Traceability ensures that every engineering conclusion, recommendation, and decision support artifact can be traced to its originating evidence, reasoning, context, and assumptions.

2. Scope

This specification applies to all cognitive artifacts and processes within Atlas.

Engineering Traceability applies to:

Engineering Observations
Engineering Evidence
Engineering Understanding
Engineering Memory
Engineering Knowledge
Engineering Reasoning
Engineering Capabilities
Decision Support
Engineering recommendations
Engineering conclusions

Traceability spans the entire engineering cognition lifecycle.

3. Canonical Definition

Engineering Traceability is the capability to identify and verify the complete chain of relationships connecting engineering observations, evidence, understanding, reasoning, decisions, and outcomes.

Engineering Traceability enables engineers to understand how and why a conclusion was reached.

4. Characteristics

Engineering Traceability SHALL possess the following characteristics.

4.1 End-to-End

Engineering Traceability SHALL support tracing across the complete engineering cognition lifecycle.

4.2 Bidirectional

Engineering Traceability SHALL support both:

Forward traceability (source → outcome)
Backward traceability (outcome → source)
4.3 Complete

Engineering Traceability SHALL preserve all material relationships influencing engineering cognition.

4.4 Verifiable

Traceability records SHALL support independent verification and audit.

4.5 Persistent

Engineering Traceability SHALL be preserved throughout the lifecycle of engineering cognition.

4.6 Explainable

Engineering Traceability SHALL enable reconstruction of the reasoning path that produced an engineering conclusion.

4.7 Technology Independent

Engineering Traceability SHALL remain independent of implementation technologies and storage mechanisms.

